nt":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"lAV4xwSqt4hjhkqY3NZlOQ","review_id":"FoOfj6JsrjzentXjysntrA","date":"2017-06-20T00:55:21","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.943253755569458,"text_excerpt":"This place was excellent. I'm not sure what was better the chargrilled oysters or the BBQ shrimp. Charles was friendly and invited us in. Dallas the cook came out to check to make sure we enjoyed outer food. Mike, the oyster guy was nice as ever, and George the waiter was great. Definitely will be back. That Happy Hour with the .75 oysters were heaven sent"},{"business_id":"lAV4xwSqt4hjhkqY3NZlOQ","review_id":"90H64Heiqa1WaONMuFdmIA","date":"2017-09-08T08:32:05","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9428421258926392,"text_excerpt":"I was here on July 4th for the oyster happy hour and the food was fantastic. I had a serving of the chargrilled oysters and it was wonderfully done, cooked to perfection!!! They had a nice helping of bread on top of that. The servers really catered to my expectations at the end when it was dessert time. They were able to deep fry the cheesecake that I saw on the menu and even that was a match made in heaven. The outer part was this warm, breaded crust and the inside was this soft melted cheesecake that wasn't too gooey. I'm sad if they are really closed."},{"business_id":"lAV4xwSqt4hjhkqY3NZlOQ","review_id":"ecwUSY3tnmXK66NEuYkxoQ","date":"2017-04-25T21:07:58","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9208943843841553,"text_excerpt":"I had the best experience here. I cannot remember my servers name, but she went above and beyond. She had us try oysters because we have never tried them before, and they were absolutely incredible. You have to get the fried oysters with butter and Parmesan! They also had incredible pasta, I ordered the penne vodka and my husband had the spaghetti and meatballs. Sooooo good!!! If I could give more than five stars I would!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"lAV4xwSqt4hjhkqY3NZlOQ","photo_id":"1LHEUDjbkqu6HfuJ2yICrg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/1LHEUDjbkqu6HfuJ2yICrg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8874753713607788},{"business_id":"lAV4xwSqt4hjhkqY3NZlOQ","photo_id":"zuc-91z7L3MMWVIkHg8uPw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/zuc-91z7L3MMWVIkHg8uPw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8758504986763},{"business_id":"lAV4xwSqt4hjhkqY3NZlOQ","photo_id":"iPR-GI-gQSfj8U0dTae0wA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/iPR-GI-gQSfj8U0dTae0wA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8068437576293945},{"business_id":"lAV4xwSqt4hjhkqY3NZlOQ","photo_id":"CquQ0uvGx1hZ5TA5Eu-nCA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/CquQ0uvGx1hZ5TA5Eu-nCA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7900533676147461},{"business_id":"lAV4xwSqt4hjhkqY3NZlOQ","photo_id":"KVYqurJ4rAUsxTxV20zBNQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/KVYqurJ4rAUsxTxV20zBNQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7403150796890259}]},"notebook_case":null}
